; Tetorica experimental SCSP DSP field assembly.
; One line is one physical microstep, with several parallel control fields.
; Missing fields and omitted physical steps are zero. The image has 128 steps.
;
; Original six-step Delay from ../dsp.js. Keep the step positions: memory I/O
; runs on odd steps in the pinned core, and SHIFTED uses the previous ACC.
; Coefficients, MADRS, ring RAM and send/return are configured by DspDelay,
; not by this text. COEF and MASA below are table indices, not their contents.

; Calculate with MEMS0 / COEF0 and a zero B input.
000: XSEL=1 YSEL=1 ZERO=1
; Issue the delay-ring read using MADRS0 + DEC.
001: XSEL=1 YSEL=1 MRD=1 ZERO=1
; Latch the preceding read into MEMS0. Preserve this pipeline step.
002: XSEL=1 YSEL=1 IWT=1 ZERO=1
; Emit the previous accumulator to EFREG0; calculate the feedback product.
003: XSEL=1 YSEL=1 EWT=1 ZERO=1 COEF=1
; Add MIXS0 * COEF2 to the accumulator (IRA 0x20 selects MIXS0).
004: XSEL=1 YSEL=1 IRA=0x20 BSEL=1 COEF=2
; Write the previous accumulator into the ring using MADRS1 + DEC.
005: XSEL=1 YSEL=1 MWT=1 ZERO=1 MASA=1

; Steps 006..127 remain zero, exactly as in the existing program.
